constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^{9}

expected time complexity: O(log(N))
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def getSmallest(self, N):
		if N == 1:
			return 1
		r = []
		for i in range(9, 1, -1):
			while N % i == 0:
				N = N // i
				r.append(str(i))
		if N > 10:
			return -1
		return ''.join(r[::-1]) if r else -1
